# Made from the recording's pauses with scripts/timings.ts, as described in TIMINGS.md.
# Two stretches of chanting are not in the chant and have no row: 00:01.74-00:04.94,
# before line 1, and 05:21.34-05:28.02, after line 56. They may be a title and a closing.
# Chants in recording order:
#   mangala-sutta
# mangala-sutta: estimated from the old line's timing in proportion to syllables, to be checked by ear: 2, 3, 4, 6.

[chant:0051 mangala-sutta]
[00:05.76]1 Evam-me sutaṁ: ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā,
[00:14.28]2 sāvatthiyaṁ viharati,
[00:18.76]3 jeta-vane
[00:21.00]4 anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme.
[00:26.59]5 Atha kho aññatarā devatā abhikkantāya rattiyā abhikkanta-vaṇṇā
[00:39.56]6 kevala-kappaṁ jetavanaṁ obhāsetvā,
[00:47.04]7 yena bhagavā ten'upasaṅkami. Upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekam-antaṁ aṭṭhāsi.
[01:05.58]8 Ekam-antaṁ ṭhitā kho sā devatā bhagavantaṁ gāthāya ajjhabhāsi:
[01:18.53]9 Bahū devā manussā ca,
[01:24.06]10 Maṅgalāni acintayuṁ;
[01:29.16]11 Ākaṅkhamānā sotthānaṁ,
[01:34.75]12 Brūhi maṅgalam-uttamaṁ.
[01:39.74]13 Asevanā ca bālānaṁ
[01:44.72]14 Paṇḍitānañ-ca sevanā
[01:49.72]15 Pūjā ca pūjanīyānaṁ
[01:55.13]16 Etam maṅgalam-uttamaṁ
[02:00.49]17 Paṭirūpa-desa-vāso ca
[02:05.88]18 Pubbe ca kata-puññatā
[02:10.69]19 Atta-sammā-paṇidhi ca
[02:15.31]20 Etam maṅgalam-uttamaṁ
[02:20.28]21 Bāhu-saccañ-ca sippañ-ca,
[02:25.69]22 Vinayo ca susikkhito
[02:29.89]23 Subhāsitā ca yā vācā
[02:35.12]24 Etam maṅgalam-uttamaṁ
[02:40.18]25 Mātā-pitu-upaṭṭhānaṁ
[02:45.42]26 Putta-dārassa saṅgaho
[02:50.19]27 Anākulā ca kammantā
[02:55.09]28 Etam maṅgalam-uttamaṁ
[03:00.00]29 Dānañ-ca dhamma-cariyā ca
[03:05.35]30 Ñātakānañ-ca saṅgaho
[03:10.60]31 Anavajjāni kammāni
[03:15.54]32 Etam maṅgalam-uttamaṁ
[03:20.61]33 Āratī viratī pāpā
[03:24.86]34 Majja-pānā ca saññamo
[03:29.98]35 Appamādo ca dhammesu
[03:35.17]36 Etam maṅgalam-uttamaṁ
[03:40.33]37 Gāravo ca nivāto ca
[03:45.76]38 Santuṭṭhī ca kataññutā
[03:50.43]39 Kālena dhammassavanaṁ
[03:55.07]40 Etam maṅgalam-uttamaṁ
[04:00.04]41 Khantī ca sovacassatā
[04:04.93]42 Samaṇānañ-ca dassanaṁ
[04:09.62]43 Kālena dhamma-sākacchā
[04:14.87]44 Etam maṅgalam-uttamaṁ
[04:19.82]45 Tapo ca brahma-cariyañ-ca
[04:24.74]46 Ariya-saccāna-dassanaṁ
[04:29.43]47 Nibbāna-sacchikiriyā ca
[04:34.67]48 Etam maṅgalam-uttamaṁ
[04:39.75]49 Phuṭṭhassa loka-dhammehi
[04:44.58]50 Cittaṁ yassa na kampati
[04:49.67]51 Asokaṁ virajaṁ khemaṁ
[04:54.48]52 Etam maṅgalam-uttamaṁ
[04:59.36]53 Etādisāni katvāna
[05:04.43]54 Sabbattham-aparājitā
[05:08.89]55 Sabbattha sotthiṁ gacchanti
[05:14.67]56 Tan-tesaṁ maṅgalam-uttaman'ti
[05:20.43]
